                                                "sense_id": "2a2d5c4e-1f68-3b40-b342-47f6c13ae891",
                                                "text": "Aray thy selfe in her most gorgeous geare"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "993fa191-2da7-49c7-a0ec-5283c128df8a",
                                                "sense_id": "2a2d5c4e-1f68-3b40-b342-47f6c13ae891",
                                                "text": "Those Eastern winters, ⁠I can't endure 'em / So every year I pack my gear and come out here till Purim / Rosh Hashanah, I spend in Arizona"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4246d934-8a1f-3a76-9292-06eeb1f8dcd3",
